OL,3,GNEWSAInside the heated debate over     
OL,4,AScotland's data centres                
OL,6,FThere is strict security in place as we
OL,7,Fenter what looks like a nondescript    
OL,8,Foffice building on the outskirts of    
OL,9,FAirdrie.                               
OL,11,FWe are stepping into a facility at the 
OL,12,Fcentre of a heated debate about the    
OL,13,Fgrowth in data centres in Scotland.    
OL,15,FOpponents argue that centres like this 
OL,16,Fone are of no benefit to the local     
OL,17,Fcommunity and damage the environment.  
OL,19,FDataVita claims its operations in North
OL,20,FLanarkshire are providing jobs and     
OL,21,Fsecuring "data sovereignty" in         
OL,22,FScotland.                              
